slices.acceptanceCriteria:
Given the full test pyramid execution via pytest and Playwright,
When unit tests evaluate the index filter, then repealed documents are verified to be absent from search results;
When API integration tests trigger POST /api/normative/sync, then HTTP 200 and updated freshness metadata are returned;
And Playwright E2E tests verify clicking the 'Актуальность' button renders expected loading states and updates badge timestamps on mobile and desktop.
